Z||000007||GTMike||09-20-2001||06:09 AM||||ok here is the deal  i have been researching this turbo and supper charge stuff for a while now.  the only way to supper and fiero is with a jack shaft.  bla bla bal.  negotory on that one. <P>turbo.  go to to turbo city . com and download their simlple secmatics on how to hook up a turbo. the only complicated part is the cross over pipe.  it connects all 6 cylinders. then goes in to the turbo.   then you have a down pippe. to your exaust. then you have a pipe going to your t-body. and one from the air filter.   that takes care of the turbo.<P>so engine management.   msd. trubeo thing retardeds you timing under boost.   then  you need more fule  so get a some ford mustand 19# injectors and a riseing rate fule regulator and your good for about 7 psi.  you wil need a boost gage and a air/rule ration gage. thats the basics of it. <P>do more reading and research. on the net.  there is soo much info out there. ||||reg||1
